ry type="html">How much damage has the unrest in France caused to a protest movement rooted in genuine grievances but hijacked by rioters, violence and vandalism? Is it a gift to Marine Le Pen, the far-right leader and presidential frontrunner? Or is it a spectre of trouble to come in a deeply polarised society, amid an increasingly poisonous political atmosphere?
 
France 24’s Gavin Lee speaks to French analyst Renaud Foucault and a senior professor of economics.</summary><category term="Spotlight" /></entry><entry><title>🔴Watch live: Macron to address France day after nationwide violent protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:56b3999065fed517b7e02b5c030d094c1d0954d22998b9d9064336f6a7f9ab54</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T17:55:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-live-vance-blames-immigration-for-violence-during-protests-in-france--a2aec9eab7bc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-live-vance-blames-immigration-for-violence-during-protests-in-france" /></entry><entry><title>Trump says 'France is burning', country 'shattered' by immigration</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:56b414bc3a0a480aecf993bcea0f9ebfb99970102fdfe9389fa56a573038b0d1</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:06Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T16:54:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-trump-says-france-is-burning-country-shattered-by-immigration--2f747d7aa2b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-trump-says-france-is-burning-country-shattered-by-immigration" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump on Sunday blamed immigration for unrest during protests in France and urged the country to tighten its migration rules. Washington bureau chief David Smith tells us more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Renewed clashes in Paris: "We've seen numerous CRS charges to disperse protesters"</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1d09e7e78cf71a8010f0e901cf5711084399db6686d360314c4bebca8cee2d03</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:09Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T16:53:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-renewed-clashes-in-paris-we-ve-seen-numerous-crs-charges-to-disperse-protesters--fa1a15e1cdbe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-renewed-clashes-in-paris-we-ve-seen-numerous-crs-charges-to-disperse-protesters" /><summary type="html">Fresh clashes broke out in Paris on Sunday, a day after France experienced one of its worst bouts of unrest in years. Protests over high prices left one demonstrator dead, thousands arrested, and shops across the country looted or damaged. France 24's Antonia Kerrigan tells us more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Israeli settlers attack European diplomats, beat French mayor</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:16c29431e2654f016b75167edb53c5c111983d6938ea46f50507ae5c202b9315</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:12Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T16:51:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-israeli-settlers-attack-european-diplomats-beat-french-mayor--d709ca30e6c2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-israeli-settlers-attack-european-diplomats-beat-french-mayor" /><summary type="html">Israeli settlers attacked a convoy of European diplomats in the West Bank and beat up a visiting French mayor on Saturday, witnesses said, while US Secretary of State Marco Rubio warned against a brewing "crisis" in the territory a day after an American photojournalist was injured in a brutal attack.</summary></entry><entry><title>France protests: "There's a constant back and forth over who's actually responsible"</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f59242130f9a7cdd3ee0c1f45389f484f75f9cee66ddd7db3db0d197998dd45</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:15Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T16:49:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-protests-there-s-a-constant-back-and-forth-over-who-s-actually-responsible--7be642619086.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-protests-there-s-a-constant-back-and-forth-over-who-s-actually-responsible" /><summary type="html">The government has blamed the violence on hard-left and ultra-left groups, as well as criminals it says instigated the looting. We discuss this with international affairs commentator Matthew-Mary Caruchet and our reporter Antonia Kerrigan.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump endorses embattled Israeli PM Netanyahu ahead of October 27 election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae8fdc7db704a04b28f952b7ea3e602501f1410cb7844268fce68a1c2cd5d0e6</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T16:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261018-trump-endorses-embattled-israeli-pm-netanyahu-ahead-of-october-27-election--a8f46cc8a76c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261018-trump-endorses-embattled-israeli-pm-netanyahu-ahead-of-october-27-election" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump on Sunday endorsed Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu ahead of Israel's October 27 elections. It was not clear what impact the endorsement would have on voters, since many Israelis have expressed disappointment with Trump over the outcome of the Iran war and the US president's ceasefire proposal.</summary><category term="Middle East" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Live: France’s CRS riot police deployed again in Paris as unrest continues</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:32162044eaf7e60591c396fcf47b4ffde33a647f8b300d60c72287f582acbbcc</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T15:40:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-live-vance-blames-immigration-for-violence-during-protests-in-france--a2aec9eab7bc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-live-vance-blames-immigration-for-violence-during-protests-in-france" /></entry><entry><title>Who capped Starlink in Ukraine? Musk, Trump and Rubio give three different answers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ad56007aeadbec9deee0d403009667ed2466985a5188f6f62e167eac1d3fd3a5</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T14:51:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/tech-24/20261018-who-capped-starlink-in-ukraine-musk-trump-and-rubio-give-three-different-answers--1e7433bc79a1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/tech-24/20261018-who-capped-starlink-in-ukraine-musk-trump-and-rubio-give-three-different-answers" /><summary type="html">Ukraine says speed limits on Starlink are still hampering military efforts to fight off Russian drones, days after a surprise network slowdown that Kyiv called deliberate and Washington denied ordering.</summary><category term="Tech 24" /></entry><entry><title>'Like we had a war': France left reeling after nationwide violent protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:763af5d9a672243c13155959b291ecbe916ca53edaa5b9cfd31b7fe626e168db</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:24Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T13:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france/20261018-like-we-had-a-war-france-left-reeling-after-nationwide-violent-protests--b4098633db7d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261018-like-we-had-a-war-france-left-reeling-after-nationwide-violent-protests" /><summary type="html">France on Sunday is dealing with the aftermath of nationwide protests that damaged around 1,500 businesses and caused losses estimated at hundreds of millions of euros. Police arrested an estimated 1,800 people across the country during Saturday's demonstrations over the cost of living and school conditions.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>The week in pictures: Escalating protests across Europe and the tragic capsize of a migrant boat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2c2be687e75d545449199f509a225189953a2813580037c44c41773216e732e7</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:27Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T13:36:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france/20261018-the-week-in-pictures-escalating-protests-across-europe-and-the-tragic-capsize-of-a-migrant---5793e5849bbd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261018-the-week-in-pictures-escalating-protests-across-europe-and-the-tragic-capsize-of-a-migrant-boat" /><summary type="html">From student protests and heightened tensions across French demonstrations on October 17, to ongoing anti-government marches in Albania and the tragic sinking of a migrant boat off the coast of Djibouti, FRANCE 24 looks back at some of the most striking images from the past week.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>'Like we had a war': France counts cost of violent protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a6cbd540669597a574e6a7ed546c6b9cdb63b5894734d5cdc462b82c7389d616</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T13:17:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-like-we-had-a-war-france-counts-cost-of-violent-protests--5386b0498b94.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-like-we-had-a-war-france-counts-cost-of-violent-protests" /><summary type="html">France was reeling on Sunday from widespread damage caused by violent protests the day before that saw 1,800 people arrested, a historic town hall torched and widespread looting.</summary></entry><entry><title>France protests: "There's a whole range of grievances at play"</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2643a76cc7b8f86aeae9eb82aafa690bb40e28a98e2895709519c97e4779c2bc</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:33Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T13:16:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-protests-there-s-a-whole-range-of-grievances-at-play--ad2db08ec5dd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-protests-there-s-a-whole-range-of-grievances-at-play" /><summary type="html">Is the anger in France driven more by declining living standards or by the perception that the economic burden is being distributed unfairly? We discuss this with our guest, Joseph Downing, senior lecturer in politics and international relations at Aston University.</summary></entry><entry><title>🔴Live: Trump says 'France is burning', blames 'immigration' for nationwide protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a4907c094aff759d74ce2bf8d250f728262ce9aacafc27e49f4922f2a835136</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T12:57:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-live-vance-blames-immigration-for-violence-during-protests-in-france--a2aec9eab7bc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-live-vance-blames-immigration-for-violence-during-protests-in-france" /></entry><entry><title>Ukrainian drone attack on Saint Petersburg kills one, sets refinery ablaze</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a5dbbcac23a2600dec72cd79806871bd26bc144ea38bf5116c5596fd616126fd</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:36Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T12:03:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-ukraine-sets-saint-petersburg-refinery-ablaze-in-large-scale-drone-attack--5c56492efee9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261018-ukraine-sets-saint-petersburg-refinery-ablaze-in-large-scale-drone-attack" /><summary type="html">A large-scale Ukrainian drone attack on Russia's second-largest city Saint Petersburg killed at least one person and hospitalised another five on Sunday. The attack – which also sparked fires at an oil refinery and depot – comes as Kyiv accused Russia of violating Washington's "energy ceasefire" dozens of times.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Paris protests: A look at the aftermath</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7d0bd94ab398f45f6e3a8d963cac23291fe9f1967dc0e4d4301413fd8d74feec</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T11:51:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-paris-protests-a-look-at-the-aftermath--b7e03a0edb66.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-paris-protests-a-look-at-the-aftermath" /><summary type="html">Following yesterday's demonstrations in Paris, where violent clashes erupted between police and protesters, our reporter Antonia Kerrigan returns to place de la République.</summary></entry><entry><title>Dozens of critically endangered orangutans saved from rampant wildfires in Indonesia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:378cb9f067615e1696987f7e6aed4d8cceb39103f9a613b3e290525390cb98cc</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:42Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T11:25:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/environment/20261018-dozens-of-critically-endangered-orangutans-saved-from-rampant-wildfires-in-indonesia--a426fda292ef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/environment/20261018-dozens-of-critically-endangered-orangutans-saved-from-rampant-wildfires-in-indonesia" /><summary type="html">Conservation groups have saved at least 51 orangutans in Indonesia from August 6 to October 19 as rampant wildfires and a months-long pollution spell have threatened their natural habitat.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Atlanta’s iconic tavern marks Georgia’s past with an eye on future as midterms approach</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d8f9293aec6dd227e4dcec6959ede8051955a0123d2734f9eaddb2116d1f213c</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T11:15:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261018-atlanta-iconic-tavern-marks-georgia-past-eye-future-midterms-approach-ossoff-collins--07358f3ce484.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261018-atlanta-iconic-tavern-marks-georgia-past-eye-future-midterms-approach-ossoff-collins" /><summary type="html">Since it was established in 1956, Manuel’s Tavern in Atlanta has hosted legendary Democratic leaders while its founder played a key role in the city’s move from a Republican to Democratic stronghold. With the state’s Democratic Senator Jon Ossoff leading the polls in the midterms amid rumours of a future presidential run, the tavern is once more at the heart of the political action.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Out-of-control truck kills 13 at Hindu festival in India</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bf8f6a9b11f3f731c6b53e51ebc2bcbee4c2911160cd111e0cf16035d96653a1</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:48Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T11:14:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-out-of-control-truck-kills-13-at-hindu-festival-in-india--33cecdb41ad0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-out-of-control-truck-kills-13-at-hindu-festival-in-india" /><summary type="html">A speeding truck in India killed 13 people when it ploughed into a crowd at a Hindu festival, officials said on Sunday, with President Droupadi Murmu describing the deaths as "heartbreaking".</summary></entry><entry><title>Riots in Tirana enter a fifth day as Albania's anti-government protests escalate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8ac4e20f0771e829279129c92afbed023ca18342270e5da1052ef5116538af52</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:51Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T11:06:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-riots-in-tirana-enter-a-fifth-day-as-albania-s-anti-government-protests-escalate--58d45e48c4d7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-riots-in-tirana-enter-a-fifth-day-as-albania-s-anti-government-protests-escalate" /><summary type="html">Clashes broke out near the Albanian prime minister’s office in the capital, Tirana, on Saturday as anti-government riots entered a fifth day.</summary></entry><entry><title>France: Protests "brought the entire population together for a common purpose"</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:18eb65adf3f82986083241e9a37d74c6949dae6627da5ffbea43b72fe873565f</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:54Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T09:05:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-protests-brought-the-entire-population-together-for-a-common-purpose--063908813143.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-protests-brought-the-entire-population-together-for-a-common-purpose" /><summary type="html">This weekend, in cities across France, some 800,000 protesters, including students, railway workers and members of the Yellow Vest movement, took to the streets in largely peaceful nationwide demonstrations. Sparked by a month of high school student protests over educational inequality and crumbling school facilities, the movement has grown into a broader outcry over the cost of living, public spending and climate inaction, as people across France say they have reached their breaking point.</summary></entry><entry><title>France: Who took part in Saturday's protests?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:61010c0df6c82645becee90e178a8fdbcd15c6fbfed85111528ee9299c09af05</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T09:03:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-who-took-part-in-saturday-s-protests--e08593a1bd17.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-who-took-part-in-saturday-s-protests" /><summary type="html">Weeks of student protests over poor conditions in schools and rising anger over the cost of living fuelled calls for a nationwide demonstration on October 17, bringing together youth activists and supporters of the Yellow Vest movement.
 
The main grievance was the cost of living. The protesters demonstrating against it 'didn't get what they wanted', analyses France 24's Shirli Sitbon.</summary></entry><entry><title>France: Who was behind the violence at Saturday's protests?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fd91860a3bb313e1bdfbbaf13d0292286071cb1d33f35846d0c27e9d6990a1ef</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:45:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T09:01:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-who-was-behind-the-violence-at-saturday-s-protests--a062891cc2a5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261018-france-who-was-behind-the-violence-at-saturday-s-protests" /><summary type="html">Violent clashes, fires, vandalism and looting marred demonstrations across France on Saturday as hundreds of thousands of people marched against the rising cost of living and poor conditions in schools. The French Interior Ministry said about 400 people were arrested nationwide. Our partner TV station France 2 examined who was involved in the violence during Saturday's protests.</summary></entry></feed>
